msgstr "مستشار"

#: .\cocuk_gelisimi\templates\cocuk_gelisimi\includes\cocuk_gelisimi.html:613
#: .\cocuk_gelisimi_programi\templates\cocuk_gelisimi_programi\includes\cocuk_gelisimi_programi.html:679
